  "description": "Idiomatic .NET SDK for the Hedera network (Hiero). Provides async access to cryptocurrency transfers, fungible and non-fungible tokens (NFTs), Hedera Consensus Service (HCS) messaging, smart contracts, file storage, scheduled transactions, airdrops, and mirror node queries. Adds experimental Block Node support (HIP-1081) for subscribing to, verifying and publishing block streams, with registered-node discovery (HIP-1137). Built on gRPC with full AOT compatibility.",
